<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">HAGPOK.SFK 19-02-2,008. Adelina Quej Xoy. Pocomchi. Updated for DBL by G. Grasso and E. Canales, Dec 2012, standardization after migration to PT8 by A. Camus March, 2019.</book>
  <para style="h">HAGEO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hag</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hag</para>
  <para style="toc1">HAGEO</para>
  <para style="mt2">RE' I RUHUUJ I HAGEO</para>
  <para style="mt1">HAGEO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' noq xq'orarik chi naa rukorjiik aha' wilik iyojeel reh i rupaat i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Wilik-oq chik rukab' haab' rokiik chi reyil Persia i reey Dario, pank'amb'al rub'eeh i ruwaaq poh, re' i QaJaaw Dios ruuk' chii' i jalal ruq'oral Hageo rub'ihnaal xuq'oreej i wilik chi ajaab'esil Judá Zorobabel rub'ihnaal, rak'uun i Saltiel. Eh xuq'oreej i kajaaw i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij Josué rub'ihnaal rak'uun i Josadac.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios nim rajaawriik reh i Hageo: Re' i tinamit wili inkiq'or noq komajaa' i rureq i q'iij chi naa kiyejaam aha' wilik i yojeel taqe reh i nupaat, inki. <verse number="3" style="v" />Xchalik i Hageo xuq'or wo' keh i tinamit i xq'orarik reh ruum i QaJaaw Dios, je' wili i xuq'or: <verse number="4" style="v" />¿Mi ruq'ijil taq cha weh re' i hat chi k'acharik taq chik i na a'n chupaam i holohaq paat, eh ma' nakapaaj ta taq ruyejeb'jiik taqe i yojinaq reh i rupaat i Dios? <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios nim rajaawriik je' wili i xuq'or taq cha weh: Chakapaaj taq riij mi ruk'ul taq i k'ahchi' kaat chi je' re'. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh nim wo' naq taq i atik i na a'n, xama' xta wo' taq inamol, i na a'n wo' naq taq awa' xama' ti nujik ta wo' taq, i na a'n wo' naq taq ahaa' xama' nik'ik ta wo' taq aachiqchi'iil, i nab'ur wo' naq taq awiib' xama' tiq'ixiinb'ik ta wo' taq. Eh re' taq i tz'aaq akamaj xa q'e' i nik'ik, xa je' pan hoop laj koxtaal taq inayeew. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hin, hin Dios nim wajaawriik, i nuq'or wo' chik taq aweh chi chakapaaj taq mi ruk'ul taq i na a'n weh chi je' re'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiy la' taq johtoq pantaq rax chee' chak'am taq chaloq taqe i chee' reh chinee taq inayejaa' taqe i yojinaq reh i nupaat, reh chinee suuqb'ik nuk'ux, eh ar taq nee kinaloq'ej. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' taq i hat k'ih naq i chib'ih taq aweh inasik', eh xa k'isiin wo' taq inareq. Eh re' inamol taq panapaat, xa ruuk' i junhuup chi wuxlaab' inwesaj taq chawach. ¿Chib'ih reet noq i nub'an taq aweh chi je' re'? Ruum re' taq i hat xa re' taq apaat i hat xayejaa', eh re' i nupaat i hin ma' nakapaaj ta taq ruyejeb'jiik, inki Dios. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh awuum taq i hat ma' nuyeew ta chik i jab' chinaah i wach ak'al, eh ruum i re' ma' wachinik ta chik taq atik. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' wo' hin xinq'ilwik reh i jab' chi ma' xub'an ta chik chinaah i wach ak'al, chinaah taq i aa-tik wilkeeb' wataq yuuq' k'ixkaab'. Eh ma' xnuyeew ta chik i jab' chinaah taq aa-trigo, chinaah taq aa-uuva, chinaah taq aa-oliva. Xkikuy kihaa' taqe i chikop, je' wo' i tinamit, ruch'ihil taqe i kamanoom, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' i Hageo jalal ruq'oral i Dios xuq'or keh chu'nchel i xq'orarik reh ruum i Dios. Eh noq xrib'iraj i Zorobabel taqe re', re' rak'uun i Salatiel, ruch'ihil i Josué k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij rak'uun i Josadac, kuch'ihil taqe i tinamit ma' k'isiin ta xkiyohleej wach i QaJaaw Dios, xkian i xuq'or. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' i Hageo jalal ruq'oral i Dios xub'an ruk'utaaj kuuk' i tinamit parub'ihnaal i QaJaaw Dios, je' wili i xuq'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: Re' hin xti korik chi naa nuwihiik kuuk', inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh ruuk' i re', re' i QaJaaw Dios xuyeew rukowiil ruk'ux i Zorobabel rak'uun i Salatiel ajaab'ees ar Judá, eh xuyeew rusuqkiil ruk'ux i Josué rak'uun Josadac kajaaw i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, eh xuyeew wo' rusuqkiil kik'ux i tinamit. Ruum i re' xi okik chi rutinamiit i yojinaq taqe reh i rupaat i Dios, inki. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh xkitoq'aa' kamanik pan kijib' ru ka'winaq rub'eeh i ruwaaq poh, ree rukab' haab' rokiik chi reyil i Dario ar Judá.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh pan jinaj ru ka'winaq rub'eeh i ruwuuq poh ree rukab' haab' re' re', re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Hageo jalal ruq'oral: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat naa a'nam ak'utaaj ruuk' i wilik chi ajaab'esil ar Judá Zorobabel rub'ihnaal rak'uun i Salatiel, je' wo' ruuk' i kajaaw i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij Josué rub'ihnaal rak'uun i Josadac, je' wo' kuuk' i tinamit, je' wili i naa aq'orom keh: <verse number="3" style="v" />¿Mi ko wilik taq jino'q chaxilak i ilwinaq chaloq i nupaat noq xkorjik cho pampeet chi xiik' naah holwochiil? ¿Mi ma' nakoj taq rehtaal re' i nupaat yu'naak chi ma' je' ta chik holwochiil noq xkorjik cho pampeet? <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' hat Zorobabel chakowej ak'ux je' wo' hat Josué kajaaw k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij chakowej wo' ak'ux. Eh chawunchelaal taq i hat wilkaat taq paruyuq'ul i Judá chakowej wo' taq ak'ux chi kamanik, re' hin neekinwihik taq awuuk' cha toob'jiik, inki i QaJaaw Dios nim rajaawriik. <verse number="5" style="v" />Je' rukab' i xnuq'or taq cha weh noq xatwisaj taq chaloq Egipto, chi naa taq nuwihiik awuuk', eh yu'naak xa wilkiin wo' taq awuuk', ruum aj re' maa yohb'isaj taq awiib'. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' hin ilook' i rureq i q'iij chi naa nuk'uyu'sam i taxaaj, i wach ak'al, i palaw, ruch'ihil i ye'aab' chiq yuuq'. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh naa wo' kib'arb'otiik chi nuwach chu'nchel i nimaq tinamit, eh naa kik'amam chaloq i kib'ehomal chupaam i nupaat, ar naaruwihiik chi manlik inuloq'il, inki i QaJaaw Dios nim rajaawriik. <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu'nchel i plata, i oro re' hin kinehchanik reh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' i nupaat naarukorjiik ruka'peech xiik' chik naah holwochiil chuwach i wilik naq cho pampeet. Eh naa nuye'em i suq laj wihik chupaam i ye'aab' wili, inki i QaJaaw Dios nim rajaawriik.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i QaJaaw Dios xuq'il taqe i tinamit yiib' wach kina'ojb'al</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh kijib'-oq chik ru ka'winaq rub'eeh i rub'eleej poh, re' rukab' haab' rokiik chi reyil i Dario, re' i QaJaaw Dios xuq'oreej wo' chik i Hageo i jalal ruq'oral. <verse number="11" style="v" />Xuq'or reh chi parub'ihnaal i reh nim rajaawriik chupahqaaj keh i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij chib'ih inkikapaaj chiriij taqe i k'uhb'aal wili. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' Hageo je' wili i xuq'or: Re' jino'q i winaq nee ruk'am reje i mayijimaj tiwik rub'otom pan itz'ihy, nenik'ik jurinoq chinaah i kaxlanwi'k, chinaah i riis uuva, chinaah i Aseite, oon chinaah i k'uxb'al wi'k. ¿Mi neenkahnik chi kuxisamaj chik taqe re'? inki. Ma' nee ta inkuxeesjik xa ruum i re', inki taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' i Hageo xupahqaaj wo' chik keh chi je' wili: Qaq'or chi wilik jino'q i neerutz'aj i kamnaq, eh nee wo' chik i rutz'aj jino'q keh i chib'ih jariik i xqaq'or, ¿Mi neenkahnik chi ch'uwa' wach? inki. Re' re' ra'j neenkahnik chi ch'uwa' wach re', inki taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' i Hageo je' wili i xuq'or: Re' i QaJaaw Dios nim rajaawriik je' wili i xuq'or: Je' wo' re' taqe i tinamit wili chu'nchel inkiyeew chi kimayiij chi nuwach, chu'nchel inki a'n xiik' naah ch'uwa'iil wach. <verse number="15" style="v" />Je' re' noq yu'naak johtoq chi qawach noq komajaa' i ntohq'ik taq ayejaam i nupaat cha kapaaj taq riij chi korik chib'ih taq i na a'nam re' re'. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh noq inakapaaj taq i hat chi naa taq amolom juninaq-oq koxtaal i wach taq atrigo xalajeeb' wo' tii koxtaal taq inamol. Eh noq inakapaaj taq i hat chi naa taq areqem lajeeb'-oq roxk'ahl ikom i riis taq aa-uuva, xa juninaq wo' tii ikom taq inareq. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' hin xnusach wach taq i aa-tik inakamaneej wach, ruuk' yab'ilaal, ruuk' saqb'och. Eh re' taq i hat xama' xinanimaj ta wo' taq ruka' pech, inki QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="18" style="v" />Chakoj taq rehtaal chi yu'naak kijib' ru ka'winaq ruk'amam rub'eeh i rub'eleej poh xtohq'ik taq akojom i raa' ch'ikaab' reh i nupaat. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ruum aj re' yu'naak taq johtoq chawach naarunujiik taq inamol wii' i wach taq atik. Yu'naak ma' rub'an ta wach i uuva, i higo, i granado, i olivo, yu'naak taq johtoq chawach naa taq kaat nukuxisam, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios chupaam wo' q'iij re' re' xuq'oreej i Hageo jalal ruq'oral, je' wili i xuq'or reh: <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' hin i nuq'or aweh chi cha q'or reh i Zorobabel wilik chi ajaab'esil ar Judá chi re' hin naanuk'uyu'sam i taxaaj, i wach ak'al. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' hin naawisam taqe pan kiye'aab' i wilkeeb' chi reyil, naa wo' wisam i kajaawriik i nimaq taq tinamit, naanusacham kiwach. Eh na naanusacham wach i kikareta, eh chi naa rukanteesjiik i kikawayu, je' wo' taqe i iqilkeeb' chiriij, re' keh xak'ul naa kikansam kiib' chikiwach ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch'. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios nim rajaawriik je' wili i xuq'or: Eh chupaam taqe i q'iij na' k'ularoq taqe i re', re' hat Zorobabel rak'uun i Salatiel waj kamanoom re' hin naanucha'jiniik aweh, je' rukab' noq inchajaljik jino'q ilopq'aaq' kojb'al ehtalil, ruum re' wo' hin xin sik'wik chaawach, inki.</para>
</usx>